---
// The one boxed Synthetic data label, placed directly under the headline.
---

<div class="note" role="note" aria-labelledby="synthetic-note-label">
  <span class="caps" id="synthetic-note-label">Synthetic data</span>
  <p>
    <strong>Every number on this page is simulated.</strong> The figures are calibrated to published
    research but none is a measured observation. Each finding compares the 2020 average with the latest
    four quarters (2025 Q3 to 2026 Q2), as a simple average across 80 countries.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .note {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1) var(--space-5);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--space-4) 1.2rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-ink);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }
  .caps {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  p {
    max-width: 75ch;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .note {
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      align-items: baseline;
    }
  }
</style>
